<title>UK: Denmarks's HNG sets NZ$130 million one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Denmarks's HNG sets NZ$130 million one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kokusai Europe Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HOVEDSTADSREGIONENS NATURGAS I/S</p>
<p> AMT     NZ$130 MLN   COUPON     7.10	MATURITY    17.OCT.97</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.35	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/=     DENOMS (K) 10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/DK</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  DENMARK   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
